5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need to be smart about who we pick. I'm worried about our capacity to actually support the team's growth.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,I agree. We should look at our past performance and how customers actually behave before we commit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not forget the financial side. We need to know what our liquidity looks like for the long haul.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,And the paperwork! I want to know if the new company will make our reporting a nightmare.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We also have a history of delays. I want to identify what specifically slows down our first deployments.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, which records do you think are most telling? I'll check the recruiters and our adviser bench.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,I'll look at the exit profiles and how accounts handled price rises. That tells the real story.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'll take the reserve accounts and the terms of our credit line. We need to know our borrowing power.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll investigate the appraisal needs at audit and the independent checks on reported figures.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll focus on the security review times and the delivery records of our current holdings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
