30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It looks like we have plenty of high-level advice available, but finding boots-on-the-ground staff is a huge bottleneck.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,George,,"Interestingly, our most stable customers are in specialized fields, while general tools are more prone to churn.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"We have a problem. Our reserves are draining faster than planned, and our credit line is very restrictive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found that hardware and physical assets make our audits way more expensive and slower to close.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Security reviews are a major drag for certain sectors, and hardware supply chains are a gamble.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@May, if the credit line is tight, does that mean we should avoid companies with high upfront costs?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, does the security delay apply to all software, or just specific types of data?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Mio. We can't afford assets that don't provide security for our loans or drain reserves.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Also, if we can't verify the numbers independently, we're just trusting their dashboards, which is risky.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, it's specifically about sensitive data like medical or financial records. That's where the lag is.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,So we need a company that doesn't need specialized field staff and doesn't overload our board.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,George,,And one with a customer base that doesn't flee when prices go up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,And it must be something that doesn't require massive follow-on capital for equipment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,I'd prefer something where the data is transparent and doesn't require a six-week outside appraisal.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Software is faster to deploy, provided it's not in a highly regulated security environment.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
