55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Looking at the candidates, Fabric Loop and Harvest Sensor both need field or warehouse staff. That's a red flag.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,George,,"Harvest Sensor has that seasonal subscription model, which usually means better retention than general tools.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,Fabric Loop's sorting facilities sound like a reserve-account nightmare. Ledger Bridge is much leaner.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Ledger Bridge is software, but Clinic Scheduler handles medical records. That means slow security reviews and audit pains.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, you're right. Clinic Scheduler will be stuck in review for months. Ledger Bridge is the fastest path.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Ledger Bridge is software, so it fits our board capacity better than a logistics-heavy business.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,George,,But is Ledger Bridge's customer base as sticky as the sensor or clinic markets?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,May,,"It's better than a company that needs a credit line for physical stock, which Fabric Loop would.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Plus, Ledger Bridge doesn't need the outside appraisals that the hardware options do.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,It avoids the supply chain risks of Harvest Sensor and the security lag of Clinic Scheduler.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm leaning toward Ledger Bridge. It's the least demanding on our human resources.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,George,,"I'm worried about the churn for a payment tool, but the others have too many operational risks.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,May,,I vote Ledger Bridge. It protects our remaining liquidity and fits our credit terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,I agree. No outside appraisals and no medical data delays. Ledger Bridge it is.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,It's the most logical choice to avoid the deployment delays we've suffered recently.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
